{"model": "Chatterbox Turbo (MLX 8-bit)", "segments": [{"text": "part 1.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c48f73789d90a33875703a853a1c3dc2e8dda31133ea45e47a332b9c6ed7a7ca.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.58]]}, {"text": "As engineers enter 2025, I am noticing a few trends in the tech world career space as Engineering Manager at a regional tech giant and unfortunately, the future looks bleak for p50 engineers.", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/2399d8a41f26a476b3cbe016342c99c20208ef2c208dbe2cf53a32b6e621d0d4.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.66], [2, 0.66, 1.04], [3, 1.04, 1.88], [4, 2.58, 2.66], [5, 2.66, 2.76], [6, 2.76, 3.12], [7, 3.12, 3.38], [8, 3.38, 3.56], [9, 3.56, 3.9], [10, 3.9, 4.16], [11, 4.16, 4.28], [12, 4.28, 4.48], [13, 4.48, 4.8], [14, 4.8, 5.16], [15, 5.16, 5.56], [16, 5.56, 5.78], [17, 5.78, 6.22], [18, 6.22, 6.72], [19, 6.72, 7.02], [20, 7.02, 7.1], [21, 7.1, 7.46], [22, 7.46, 7.82], [23, 7.82, 8.28], [24, 8.78, 8.86], [25, 8.86, 9.54], [26, 9.96, 10.02], [27, 10.02, 10.32], [28, 10.32, 10.6], [29, 10.6, 11.04], [30, 11.04, 11.22], [31, 11.22, 11.74], [32, 11.74, 12.24]]}, {"text": "Lower Demand", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/7a4e0874de2265e7c337598dd19e453df0443d9472c8c4ecceab980eef194e96.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.66]]}, {"text": "Managers Are Incentivized to Hire in Low-Cost Regions", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/af1e2d3416466967d59ad276acb5fc2264ad0aed0ad4c05067436116990b0f80.mp3"}, {"text": "Managers are measured by headcount.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/1554a569d7dd30b8e3793eb844e237cd823fdb7a1715faa5cbd63ec2da69ab72.mp3"}, {"text": "The number of people they oversee reflects the trust the organization places in them and the value it expects them to generate.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/8d2d7f526d8fb3aa6d477132611979fcbde7c9a0a05aec75b0add6969dac909d.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.56], [3, 0.56, 0.84], [4, 0.84, 1.0], [5, 1.0, 1.44], [6, 1.44, 1.96], [7, 1.96, 2.3], [8, 2.3, 2.56], [9, 2.82, 2.86], [10, 2.86, 3.4], [11, 3.4, 3.88], [12, 3.88, 4.08], [13, 4.08, 4.3], [14, 4.62, 4.8], [15, 4.8, 4.9], [16, 4.9, 5.22], [17, 5.22, 5.4], [18, 5.4, 5.7], [19, 5.7, 6.0], [20, 6.0, 6.14], [21, 6.14, 6.48]]}, {"text": "Growing that number often translates directly to career advancement.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/78ab9395eee7d93a8a7ca7d59b39a66d722f62a33328330ee751b7c49f08f5e4.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.32], [1, 0.32, 0.56], [2, 0.56, 0.88], [3, 0.88, 1.26], [4, 1.26, 1.7], [5, 1.7, 2.2], [6, 2.2, 2.42], [7, 2.42, 2.66], [8, 2.66, 3.16]]}, {"text": "It’s why a common interview question for management roles is: “How many people do you manage?”—followed closely by, “Do you manage other managers?”", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/71a1fa0f7704b62d7b4f63b04a071b761d6c46781504c5691d348b771ca0f36b.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.54], [3, 0.54, 0.74], [4, 0.74, 1.08], [5, 1.08, 1.56], [6, 1.56, 1.78], [7, 1.78, 2.04], [8, 2.04, 2.4], [9, 2.4, 2.94], [11, 3.4, 3.6], [12, 3.6, 3.94], [13, 3.94, 4.14], [14, 4.14, 4.24], [16, 5.7, 6.14], [17, 6.14, 6.42], [18, 6.42, 6.78], [19, 6.78, 6.9], [20, 6.9, 7.12], [21, 7.12, 7.42], [22, 7.42, 7.88]]}, {"text": "When it comes to layoffs, managers and directors don’t want to cut staff.", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/ed22354739ba22e716e10beb5eeefa087f6aea0b9f20052e755173ea0417428f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.54], [3, 0.54, 0.78], [4, 0.78, 1.24], [5, 1.76, 2.08], [6, 2.08, 2.28], [7, 2.28, 2.7], [8, 2.7, 3.18], [9, 3.18, 3.32], [10, 3.32, 3.42], [11, 3.42, 3.56], [12, 3.56, 3.88]]}, {"text": "Their incentive is to maintain control over their organization and its influence within the company.", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/94ae702e5e8b5aebc72f50673d7df0349332643976b6f2bac218989b17531ea6.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.58], [2, 0.58, 0.82], [3, 0.82, 0.94], [4, 0.94, 1.2], [5, 1.2, 1.76], [6, 1.76, 2.2], [7, 2.2, 2.4], [8, 2.4, 3.06], [9, 3.06, 3.36], [10, 3.36, 3.52], [11, 3.52, 3.9], [12, 3.9, 4.28], [13, 4.28, 4.42], [14, 4.42, 4.78]]}, {"text": "But when finance orders a 5% reduction in headcount costs, directors have limited choices:", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/8f29f82151e6895e5f00b3e04ec7869436e9cc3b718a9ea0c8476c06ae31e9cd.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.78], [3, 0.78, 1.24], [4, 1.24, 1.48], [5, 1.48, 1.76], [6, 2.04, 2.52], [7, 2.52, 2.82], [9, 3.26, 3.82], [10, 4.22, 4.46], [11, 4.46, 4.72], [12, 4.72, 5.0], [13, 5.0, 5.52]]}, {"text": "Lay off employees and rehire in lower-cost markets [0]", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/37bf4cfd76f0fd0bc4d6fa9429154baa354e0ddda6bf35f4c8ccbff29a7ddcf5.mp3"}, {"text": "Implement return-to-office (RTO) policies to drive attrition (canceling backfills)", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/810d518bbe71c41a61fce1a9496f4a446802562f05dbb755d45a7bb3aad68e80.mp3"}, {"text": "In 2023, Big Tech companies opted for layoffs with generous severance packages.", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/158c35f13ecdb4ae206c1cd0baf46c0622df53b4e7a6431f291ea21d0c73b0fe.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.98], [2, 1.48, 1.58], [3, 1.58, 1.78], [4, 1.78, 2.2], [5, 2.2, 2.64], [6, 2.64, 2.86], [7, 2.86, 3.2], [8, 3.2, 3.44], [9, 3.44, 3.76], [10, 3.76, 4.24], [11, 4.24, 4.66]]}, {"text": "In 2024, they pushed RTO mandates and canceled remote positions.", "block": 9, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/511ce923a861970d65d9bc40ce1a71827577c2e7715fbb3c20b89fd6ed280383.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.82], [2, 1.26, 1.32], [3, 1.32, 1.62], [4, 1.62, 2.04], [5, 2.04, 2.46], [6, 2.46, 2.74], [8, 3.1, 3.4], [9, 3.4, 3.82]]}, {"text": "In 2025, they cut deeply into “low performers” to avoid severance payouts.", "block": 10, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/fd32ea1884970d787e2acfef866942632f305dde4e7234cb3b4bf6544458e666.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.62], [3, 1.18, 1.34], [4, 1.34, 1.72], [5, 1.72, 1.98], [6, 1.98, 2.22], [7, 2.22, 2.76], [8, 2.76, 3.1], [9, 3.1, 3.38], [10, 3.38, 3.86], [11, 3.86, 4.42]]}, {"text": "As American workers are laid off, headcount shifts to abroad—evident in the continued surge of hiring in Bengaluru (timesofindia.indiatimes.com).", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/6ecca8117eb667c8d13d97f7c6dda2f59ae464f9b1af02b8fe591e9bfdde00e9.mp3"}, {"text": "Bangalore remains at the forefront of India’s job market, boasting a 9.3% increase in job opportunities and salary growth compared to last year, as reported by TeamLease Services in its Jobs and Salaries Primer Report for FY 23-24.", "block": 12, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/7b5dc96b6e33ba9239647068f2280b03d90946b9bb41dc92fbc1f5de69ee635b.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.54, 0.82], [2, 0.82, 1.12], [3, 1.12, 1.26], [4, 1.26, 1.62], [5, 1.62, 2.0], [6, 2.0, 2.44], [7, 2.44, 2.6], [8, 2.6, 3.02], [9, 3.48, 3.84], [10, 3.84, 4.08], [12, 5.26, 5.8], [13, 5.8, 6.12], [14, 6.12, 6.36], [15, 6.36, 7.0], [16, 7.0, 7.32], [17, 7.32, 7.66], [18, 7.66, 8.08], [19, 8.08, 8.5], [20, 8.5, 8.7], [21, 8.7, 8.88], [22, 8.88, 9.2], [23, 9.62, 9.76], [24, 9.76, 10.04], [25, 10.04, 10.28], [27, 10.8, 11.14], [28, 11.14, 11.56], [29, 11.56, 11.74], [31, 12.04, 12.3], [32, 12.3, 12.76], [33, 12.76, 13.16], [34, 13.16, 13.5], [35, 13.5, 13.9]]}, {"text": "Oct 2024, peoplematters.in", "block": 13, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/4f0fbd5120f3c4646ccc3796f4653bf837045bd54e4ca8490994133475f74958.mp3"}, {"text": "Cost shift", "block": 14, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/7eb02ed69e091d7b737867a26f68f5f43b953f60bbd48e8b6305d8806f195ea5.mp3"}, {"text": "Startups and dev shops were once the launchpads for CS grads from non-traditional backgrounds.", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/89b9c8c77267fe22dd133c5d16d81b6ac999fb8e868777bd7aa042224a3996d1.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.46], [1, 0.46, 0.64], [2, 0.64, 0.78], [3, 0.78, 1.06], [4, 1.06, 1.3], [5, 1.3, 1.54], [6, 1.54, 1.7], [8, 2.26, 2.42], [9, 2.42, 2.68], [10, 2.68, 3.22], [11, 3.22, 3.44], [13, 4.18, 4.62]]}, {"text": "Experienced engineers flocked to big tech for higher pay, better work-life balance, and lower career risk.", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/1f2ee3ee54432e2f77e942339998ebfb9ace8fff69223d5ec3dd86a6c4e37405.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.76], [1, 0.76, 1.24], [2, 1.24, 1.86], [3, 1.86, 2.0], [5, 2.14, 2.38], [6, 2.38, 2.64], [7, 2.64, 2.88], [8, 2.88, 3.22], [9, 3.64, 3.8], [11, 4.22, 4.62], [12, 5.04, 5.14], [13, 5.14, 5.38], [14, 5.38, 5.72], [15, 5.72, 6.16]]}, {"text": "With limited budgets, startups would hire fresh grads—university or coding bootcamp graduates—as low-cost, diamond-in-the-rough talent.", "block": 16, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/5826c9f723eeb36dbb81862b0dca3565b6dd69293fc5917186de4992a41ce47d.mp3"}, {"text": "After 2-4 years of experience, these engineers would often move to senior roles at big tech companies, doubling their pay and scope.", "block": 16, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f4a54dafce718b4699ceef4ec58f8386e8ad265e736d0f8445c6f818dd59a7db.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.34], [2, 0.82, 1.1], [3, 1.1, 1.34], [4, 1.34, 1.88], [5, 2.46, 2.6], [6, 2.6, 3.08], [7, 3.08, 3.46], [8, 3.46, 3.76], [9, 3.76, 4.0], [10, 4.0, 4.18], [11, 4.18, 4.46], [12, 4.46, 4.82], [13, 4.82, 5.02], [15, 5.16, 5.36], [16, 5.36, 5.94], [17, 6.3, 6.6], [18, 6.6, 6.84], [19, 6.84, 7.08], [20, 7.08, 7.36], [21, 7.36, 7.7]]}, {"text": "But today, fewer startups are getting funding, and many are more open to hiring internationally to stretch their budgets.", "block": 17, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/bf1c1da43d297a1a1df1868e361abde8ca8a55ba01fd9092bc1eaa3bc7bcf16d.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.12], [1, 0.12, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.8], [3, 0.8, 1.26], [4, 1.26, 1.52], [5, 1.52, 1.7], [6, 1.7, 2.16], [7, 2.42, 2.62], [8, 2.62, 2.86], [9, 2.86, 3.08], [10, 3.08, 3.24], [11, 3.24, 3.56], [12, 3.56, 3.72], [13, 3.72, 3.98], [14, 3.98, 4.68], [15, 4.68, 5.06], [16, 5.06, 5.34], [17, 5.34, 5.5], [18, 5.5, 5.8]]}, {"text": "This shift leads to…", "block": 17, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/a90ba22098357e9fd6c996af7dff14a8a24b88b909b43b4c4a36c79f294676f5.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 0.88], [3, 0.88, 1.74]]}, {"text": "More Supply", "block": 18, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/d9bea5ddfebca57cc1ba42cfb286642fac9408adfdb7dd0e64d71b2b08d40704.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.68]]}, {"text": "The number of people who can code is growing at an unprecedented rate—fueled by formal education, bootcamps, and self-taught developers.", "block": 19, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/23013c3603eed8564ea2f64665391a313898bf1c81bd1312272c2148a7f95832.mp3"}, {"text": "This isn’t just a trend; it’s an economic shift.", "block": 19, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/df7b865f8d1c76b4d89a68d513238610560af8d8d24fa4a34ab3a0004a50eb4b.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 0.7], [3, 0.7, 0.82], [4, 0.82, 1.28], [5, 1.6, 1.74], [6, 1.74, 1.8], [7, 1.8, 2.24], [8, 2.24, 2.8]]}, {"text": "Locally", "block": 20, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/1b79568742f7c44938b78b1483907c857d6597276c6671bb92b07114a70e5b8c.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.5]]}, {"text": "Coding bootcamps now graduate hundreds of thousands of students each year.", "block": 21, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b5713a48746e66d66d9cbb7b5ae7fbbe524dff5fc9e3ed67067d9acd58782068.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.36], [2, 0.96, 1.08], [3, 1.08, 1.44], [4, 1.44, 1.92], [5, 1.92, 2.18], [6, 2.18, 2.5], [7, 2.5, 2.72], [8, 2.72, 3.08], [9, 3.08, 3.32], [10, 3.32, 3.6]]}, {"text": "Even if only 10% land jobs, that still adds tens of thousands of new developers competing in the market.", "block": 21, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/3f405316113d2c20efa0b207add9bfde51b903ec744d07b887742f6037581dbb.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.36], [2, 0.5, 0.68], [3, 0.68, 0.94], [4, 1.26, 1.5], [5, 1.5, 1.86], [6, 1.86, 2.16], [7, 2.16, 2.48], [8, 2.48, 2.7], [9, 2.7, 3.0], [10, 3.0, 3.28], [11, 3.28, 3.68], [12, 3.68, 4.06], [13, 4.06, 4.22], [14, 4.22, 4.76], [15, 4.76, 5.26], [16, 5.26, 5.52], [17, 5.52, 5.6], [18, 5.6, 5.9]]}, {"text": "In 2015, fewer than 20,000 professionals attended coding bootcamps to improve or reskill.", "block": 22, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/8d48fc7e367fd527a89edd9922ea4781dbcbe45ebc7800c443b1cef65b007c8d.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.88], [2, 1.32, 1.48], [3, 1.48, 1.68], [5, 2.52, 3.04], [6, 3.04, 3.58], [7, 3.58, 3.96], [8, 3.96, 4.5], [9, 4.5, 4.72], [10, 4.72, 5.08], [11, 5.08, 5.48], [12, 5.48, 5.94]]}, {"text": "By 2021, that number had grown fivefold to 100,000.", "block": 22, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/941b3dbedff707bb72c8cbd68d07ad0b7d66c257b3f095c06b3a7a2e8e8c6e5d.mp3"}, {"text": "By 2025, it’s projected to reach 380,000.", "block": 22, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/ab3505c30ee5bf46b4cb8243e0411f1fcb9305e49afb23e08eca00f1a58c4369.mp3"}, {"text": "— HolonIQ", "block": 22, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/8c6d46daedfe01ab667495ccc89b34222a194037906874dc4e6d99b00de01149.mp3"}, {"text": "Pop culture has also played a role.", "block": 23, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c7b39b90a8b9c73ec62605f0e8d656918fdfd3d1c752211c9eec25af10c0db5b.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.2, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 0.72], [3, 0.72, 1.0], [4, 1.0, 1.26], [5, 1.26, 1.38], [6, 1.38, 1.6]]}, {"text": "The Social Network appeared on over 70 critics’ top 10 lists (Wikipedia).", "block": 23, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b42b4cd8c92908fd8b8fc12d470c487353fe0a9a3ddd76a24eb3d151395b095c.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.72], [3, 0.72, 1.12], [4, 1.12, 1.3], [5, 1.3, 1.56], [6, 1.56, 1.96], [7, 1.96, 2.38], [8, 2.38, 2.66], [9, 2.66, 2.92], [10, 2.92, 3.24], [11, 3.68, 3.98]]}, {"text": "The rise of YouTube coding influencers, Twitch live-coding streams, and viral TikToks about tech salaries has made programming more aspirational than ever..", "block": 23, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/37e3286fffd3bb1b9938ba60fd8c91f5cc160cf1bbcba544531ccfc63dced35a.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.6], [3, 0.6, 0.88], [4, 0.88, 1.24], [5, 1.24, 1.92], [6, 2.44, 2.6], [8, 3.12, 3.58], [9, 3.92, 3.98], [10, 3.98, 4.3], [11, 4.3, 4.92], [12, 4.92, 5.08], [13, 5.08, 5.32], [14, 5.32, 5.76], [15, 5.76, 6.18], [16, 6.18, 6.34], [17, 6.34, 6.8], [18, 6.8, 7.1], [19, 7.1, 7.76], [20, 7.76, 7.92], [21, 7.92, 8.18]]}, {"text": "Even viral trends like “How old are you, and how much do you make?”", "block": 23, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/5a3febc894e066ced3e444cf122c12c07d2306d575175b01aada31124db1280d.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.36], [1, 0.36, 0.72], [2, 0.72, 1.14], [3, 1.14, 1.38], [5, 1.84, 2.06], [6, 2.06, 2.16], [7, 2.16, 2.4], [8, 2.4, 2.82], [9, 2.82, 2.94], [10, 2.94, 3.12], [11, 3.12, 3.3], [12, 3.3, 3.4], [13, 3.4, 3.56]]}, {"text": "fuel interest in tech careers.", "block": 23, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/82354582ade01aff589dadf85de000ceafa63f5d06560dd75c3273650020c608.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.66], [3, 0.92, 1.02], [4, 1.02, 1.38]]}, {"text": "Meanwhile, the number of computer science graduates continues to rise.", "block": 24, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/ec2dc1a8feac69a73d5ad4f8ea1411b08ec15b02cb0b642847fd51dc02926288.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.38], [1, 0.6, 0.7], [2, 0.7, 0.88], [3, 0.88, 1.04], [4, 1.04, 1.3], [5, 1.3, 1.66], [6, 1.66, 2.06], [7, 2.06, 2.56], [8, 2.56, 2.74], [9, 2.74, 2.98]]}, {"text": "In 2021, U.S. universities produced over 100,000 CS graduates (NCES).", "block": 24, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/812df81602b7bbca40ed10b6caebb63667a689ae03c8dc55d9c2ab8bf0a8abac.mp3"}, {"text": "This shift doesn’t just affect those laid off—it also increases competition for those still in the job market.", "block": 25, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/86360a2490f9666180884f863a50cc5a21e009a1c42d2ad46be132b0d1faa84f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.98], [3, 0.98, 1.2], [4, 1.2, 1.58], [5, 1.58, 1.94], [6, 1.94, 2.14], [8, 2.68, 2.9], [9, 2.9, 3.4], [10, 3.4, 3.98], [11, 3.98, 4.34], [12, 4.34, 4.58], [13, 4.58, 4.88], [14, 4.88, 5.04], [15, 5.04, 5.14], [16, 5.14, 5.32], [17, 5.32, 5.66]]}, {"text": "The top 30 H-1B employers hired 34,000 new H-1B workers in 2022 while laying off at least 85,000 workers in 2022 and early 2023.", "block": 26, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/29dc50d96f4ef0ddedea36845b29bb2dd44fe3f212af61befed975b0f5f7dca6.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.66], [3, 0.66, 1.28], [4, 1.28, 1.92], [5, 1.92, 2.24], [7, 3.28, 3.58], [8, 3.58, 4.28], [9, 4.28, 4.68], [10, 4.68, 5.1], [11, 5.1, 5.84], [12, 5.84, 6.32], [13, 6.32, 6.54], [14, 6.54, 6.82], [15, 6.82, 6.98], [16, 6.98, 7.14], [18, 8.22, 8.52], [19, 8.52, 8.78], [20, 8.78, 9.48], [21, 9.48, 10.14], [22, 10.14, 10.48], [23, 10.48, 11.08]]}, {"text": "— EPI", "block": 26, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/6919d50853b6218eacc575496c5e2b8b3c88c37f3cd673ef5a64e38716550c70.mp3"}, {"text": "Internationally", "block": 27, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/9c87581c55301fd2857894e0b77139f11dfc9ce28180380a6778ab64a6a92e8e.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.92]]}, {"text": "Thomas Friedman once said, “The world is flat.”", "block": 28, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f8e7dcb2e13bb635a70ac39c0367589ca68752197554b94cd4ca4b8439504732.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.34], [1, 0.34, 0.74], [2, 0.74, 0.96], [3, 0.96, 1.38], [5, 1.86, 2.12], [6, 2.12, 2.34], [7, 2.34, 2.64]]}, {"text": "That remains true today.", "block": 28, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b298d1490d40a92f3d9b7ff417257d3fb5966794fe4fae042fca3b3b1a97b9a5.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.82], [3, 0.82, 1.1]]}, {"text": "As access to technology and education spreads, the dominance of any one country in coding skills is rapidly eroding.", "block": 28, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/ece7ff8c9b9756330bf58c6c8a6b68471eb1ec225a056bcb92c399ff259fb303.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.22, 0.6], [2, 0.6, 0.84], [3, 0.84, 1.42], [4, 1.42, 1.68], [5, 1.68, 2.2], [6, 2.2, 2.82], [7, 3.26, 3.36], [8, 3.36, 3.76], [9, 3.76, 4.04], [10, 4.04, 4.28], [11, 4.28, 4.56], [12, 4.56, 4.98], [15, 5.32, 5.82], [16, 5.82, 6.16], [17, 6.16, 6.58], [18, 6.58, 7.06]]}, {"text": "Fifteen years ago, if you lived in South America or Asia, learning to code meant first learning English and getting reliable access to a computer—barriers that put American kids five years ahead of the rest of the world.", "block": 29, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/8cbc309f20f0f538385ca94c95ae15c6221ebd96b59c6ea953fd1fbecf2a5346.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.5, 0.74], [2, 0.74, 1.12], [3, 1.6, 1.82], [4, 1.82, 1.92], [5, 1.92, 2.16], [6, 2.16, 2.3], [7, 2.3, 2.58], [8, 2.58, 2.96], [9, 2.96, 3.36], [10, 3.36, 3.78], [11, 4.5, 4.8], [12, 4.8, 5.04], [13, 5.04, 5.32], [14, 5.32, 5.52], [15, 5.52, 5.82], [16, 5.82, 6.2], [17, 6.2, 6.64], [18, 7.1, 7.42], [19, 7.42, 7.62], [20, 7.62, 8.1], [21, 8.1, 8.52], [22, 8.52, 8.88], [23, 8.88, 8.98], [25, 9.76, 10.1], [26, 10.1, 10.28], [27, 10.28, 10.64], [28, 10.64, 11.02], [29, 11.02, 11.46], [30, 11.46, 11.7], [31, 11.7, 11.96], [32, 11.96, 12.12], [33, 12.12, 12.22], [34, 12.22, 12.38], [35, 12.38, 12.58], [36, 12.58, 12.68], [37, 12.68, 13.04]]}, {"text": "But in the last five years, that gap has shrunk dramatically.", "block": 29, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c23b5f27ba88b5d2d3c71d869abf1a4259ba779999949118a8f263db5adae05a.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.28], [2, 0.28, 0.36], [3, 0.36, 0.52], [4, 0.52, 0.86], [5, 0.86, 1.28], [6, 1.54, 1.66], [7, 1.66, 1.84], [8, 1.84, 2.04], [9, 2.04, 2.32], [10, 2.32, 2.74]]}, {"text": "Low-cost laptops are now widely available in developing countries.", "block": 30, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/9a4c3b6260449d13daecd6ebafe1cc5dded78c1d7308c5dad118f066dafc9dfd.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.42, 0.8], [2, 0.8, 1.04], [3, 1.04, 1.2], [4, 1.2, 1.54], [5, 1.54, 2.06], [6, 2.06, 2.46], [7, 2.46, 2.8], [8, 2.8, 3.26]]}, {"text": "Online and in-person English classes make documentation more accessible.", "block": 31, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/68c70a063f94d0b99f27498e7eb95446a7a6a8cc67dae44c37c6c4329fa7b356.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.4], [1, 0.4, 0.74], [3, 1.26, 1.62], [4, 1.62, 2.14], [5, 2.14, 2.46], [6, 2.46, 3.04], [7, 3.04, 3.5], [8, 3.5, 3.98]]}, {"text": "Free and paid coursework is available to anyone with an internet connection.", "block": 32, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/0fc52d63cf150eb92c4b6ce24b495ab09f86767b2e35f35da9c5069460c13e18.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.36], [1, 0.36, 0.62], [2, 0.62, 0.88], [3, 0.88, 1.5], [4, 1.5, 1.68], [5, 1.68, 2.02], [6, 2.02, 2.26], [7, 2.26, 2.58], [8, 2.58, 2.76], [9, 2.76, 2.86], [10, 2.86, 3.18], [11, 3.18, 3.62]]}, {"text": "Big Tech has also played a role.", "block": 33, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/bc62de5cd4ccff67dabe965a6818bc84546176d046dddd95017cb085602a04a4.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.34], [1, 0.34, 0.64], [2, 0.64, 0.9], [3, 0.9, 1.28], [4, 1.28, 1.54], [5, 1.54, 1.7], [6, 1.7, 1.92]]}, {"text": "Companies hiring internationally don’t just fill positions—they train engineers who previously had little access to formal CS education.", "block": 33, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/3f3005ad87f083dffe6b7cc8afb8a6604374bf21589ec04b0ddcb16b9b0ed77a.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.5], [1, 0.5, 1.0], [2, 1.0, 1.9], [3, 1.9, 2.42], [4, 2.42, 2.58], [5, 2.58, 2.84], [7, 3.74, 4.0], [8, 4.0, 4.56], [9, 4.56, 4.84], [10, 4.84, 5.34], [11, 5.34, 5.6], [12, 5.6, 5.86], [13, 5.86, 6.32], [14, 6.32, 6.62], [15, 6.62, 6.9], [16, 6.9, 7.2], [17, 7.2, 7.7]]}, {"text": "When I traveled to Vietnam in 2016, I remember thinking how difficult it was to succeed as a coder there.", "block": 34, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/87dc0b35799ac9cc4b54e2db8a9521974db97a1ccbe8c84878040b2c8406c2c4.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.68], [3, 0.68, 0.86], [4, 0.86, 1.06], [5, 1.06, 1.36], [6, 1.36, 1.98], [7, 2.4, 2.46], [8, 2.46, 2.82], [9, 2.82, 3.14], [10, 3.14, 3.4], [11, 3.4, 3.72], [12, 3.72, 4.02], [13, 4.02, 4.22], [14, 4.22, 4.52], [15, 4.52, 4.9], [16, 4.9, 5.24], [17, 5.24, 5.32], [18, 5.32, 5.64], [19, 5.64, 5.84]]}, {"text": "Before even starting web development, you needed to learn English just to read the documentation for Twitter Bootstrap or Ruby on Rails.", "block": 34, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/907addfa16f1c1b485934c196a2ec36060dc0b7bb8969e36d044b907b9a9d45f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.48], [1, 0.48, 0.72], [2, 0.72, 1.04], [3, 1.04, 1.22], [4, 1.22, 1.72], [5, 2.06, 2.12], [6, 2.12, 2.34], [7, 2.34, 2.52], [8, 2.52, 2.7], [9, 2.7, 3.06], [10, 3.06, 3.38], [11, 3.38, 3.58], [12, 3.58, 3.7], [13, 3.7, 3.82], [14, 3.82, 4.34], [15, 4.34, 4.78], [16, 4.78, 5.02], [17, 5.02, 5.5], [18, 5.5, 5.7], [19, 5.7, 5.94], [20, 5.94, 6.12], [21, 6.12, 6.34]]}, {"text": "Fast forward to 2025, and things look different.", "block": 35, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/51f0713bd82d27230db1141efdb4994f584ebdddf639f176570170aea66b983a.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.48], [2, 0.48, 0.66], [3, 0.66, 1.3], [4, 1.3, 1.88], [5, 1.88, 2.08], [6, 2.08, 2.24], [7, 2.24, 2.6]]}, {"text": "React documentation is now fully available in six languages, with partial translations in 32 more.", "block": 35, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/cb0e4a98215e1c6d28a09e7a51650d76f979d0b48e2f94bb65b0216af6f7616d.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.46, 0.92], [2, 0.92, 1.32], [3, 1.32, 1.48], [4, 1.48, 1.84], [5, 1.84, 2.34], [6, 2.34, 2.64], [7, 2.64, 2.96], [8, 2.96, 3.48], [9, 3.9, 4.14], [10, 4.14, 4.46], [11, 4.46, 5.12], [12, 5.12, 5.44], [13, 5.44, 5.88], [14, 5.88, 6.28]]}, {"text": "With tools like ChatGPT, Google Translate, and YouTube, English proficiency is no longer a prerequisite for learning to code.", "block": 35, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/2211382cdeb911c09cd6f3d7c5a00dec9582cd3582b7f30b4821b08ff88c1c48.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.56], [2, 0.56, 0.92], [4, 2.26, 2.42], [5, 2.42, 2.98], [6, 3.24, 3.26], [7, 3.26, 3.66], [8, 4.38, 4.6], [9, 4.6, 5.22], [10, 5.22, 5.56], [11, 5.56, 5.7], [12, 5.7, 6.02], [13, 6.02, 6.16], [14, 6.16, 6.76], [15, 6.76, 6.96], [16, 6.96, 7.2], [17, 7.2, 7.42], [18, 7.42, 7.68]]}, {"text": "At Grab, we’ve hired many talented engineers with limited English skills.", "block": 35, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/581440a031519b25bce9cfcc26aa0fbf64849df6a1c8feaac10364ca9fafb185.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.32], [1, 0.32, 0.54], [2, 0.9, 1.1], [3, 1.1, 1.3], [4, 1.3, 1.58], [5, 1.58, 1.92], [6, 1.92, 2.4], [7, 2.4, 2.68], [8, 2.68, 2.94], [9, 2.94, 3.28], [10, 3.28, 3.64]]}, {"text": "The global talent pool isn’t just growing—it’s leveling the playing field.", "block": 36, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/edf03ec7c24e1b811503e526fa761d0ea409dc282fe6588d30d758a455d8e8e3.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.84], [3, 0.84, 1.24], [4, 1.24, 1.72], [5, 1.72, 1.92], [7, 2.6, 3.04], [8, 3.04, 3.28], [9, 3.28, 3.58], [10, 3.58, 3.92]]}, {"text": "A coder in São Paulo or Bangalore now has access to the same knowledge and opportunities as one in Silicon Valley.", "block": 36, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/eece4e00632ea333baf95bf916629287c09f87d56238a50ea81142646b77bba9.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.12], [1, 0.12, 0.5], [2, 0.5, 0.74], [4, 1.04, 1.42], [5, 1.42, 1.72], [6, 1.72, 2.26], [7, 2.26, 2.48], [8, 2.48, 2.72], [9, 2.72, 3.04], [10, 3.04, 3.3], [11, 3.3, 3.42], [12, 3.42, 3.68], [13, 3.68, 4.02], [14, 4.02, 4.26], [15, 4.26, 4.84], [16, 4.84, 5.24], [17, 5.24, 5.46], [18, 5.46, 5.68], [19, 5.68, 5.96], [20, 5.96, 6.42]]}, {"text": "The future of tech isn’t just in the U.S.—it’s everywhere.", "block": 36, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/6cfac24ac7c92b9ef2e49873a4841cb2bdc19dd45ef09a2c86fe56ef30ddac15.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.56], [2, 0.56, 0.78], [3, 0.78, 0.98], [4, 0.98, 1.42], [5, 1.42, 1.64], [6, 1.64, 1.92], [7, 1.92, 2.04], [9, 2.64, 3.04]]}, {"text": "Part 2 will discuss the Data Science field.", "block": 37, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/d2ae4131373b5b25e74ae1278bfe99fc4f2139c0b72629b497328f6813d39eae.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.54], [2, 0.54, 0.74], [3, 0.74, 1.02], [4, 1.02, 1.26], [5, 1.26, 1.48], [6, 1.48, 1.88], [7, 1.88, 2.3]]}]}